  "releaseNotes": "v6.0.0 - .NET 11 support, package dependency updates (JwtBearer 11, Swashbuckle 11, Scalar 3, Halifax.Core 6.0.0)\nv5.3.5 - Add Source Link and a symbol package (snupkg) for source-level debugging\n            v5.3.4 - Package dependency updates\nv5.3.3 - Package dependency updates\nv5.3.2 - Package dependency updates\nv5.3.1 - Ship XML documentation in the package, enrich API docs, dependency updates, Halifax.Core 5.2.1\nv5.3.0 - Package dependency updates (Swashbuckle, Scalar, JwtBearer, Halifax.Core 5.2.0)\nv5.2.3 - Package dependency updates\nv5.2.2 - Update Halifax.Core to 5.1.2\nv5.2.1 - Package dependency updates\nv5.2.0 - Correlation ID middleware, structured version endpoint, nullable reference types\nv5.0.x - .NET 10 support\nv4.0.x - .NET 9 support\nv3.2.x - Use global exception handler\nv3.1.x - Minor improvements to the APIs\nv3.0.x - .NET 8 support\nv2.0.x - .NET 7 support. Improvements and bugfixes\nv1.3.x - Configuration improvements\nv1.3.5 - Claim extensions added\nv1.3.x - Package version updates and minor improvements\nv1.x.x - Stable version\nv0.x.x - Initial release",
